<div class="article-header">
  <h1>Contributor Guidelines</h1>
  <p class="lead">Editorial standards, submission process, and topic-fit guidelines for prospective contributors. We publish bylined research, operator interviews, and case studies from Maine cannabis practitioners, researchers, and policy specialists.</p>
